# every tick is still sampled about twice, and the quantity claimed from this
# file is a SUSTAINED DISPLACEMENT (mm of eye travel) plus the SHAPE of a
# 0.15 s ramp, neither of which decimation can hide. It is NOT a per-frame
# meander like docs/FINDING_RUN_SMEAR.md, where every frame had to be kept.
